# megatoy's formatting: LLVM style, which is what the codebase has always
# followed -- 2-space indent, attached braces, no namespace indentation,
# 80-column limit, right-aligned pointers.
#
# This file exists so editors stop guessing. Without it, VSCode's C++
# extension falls back to its own default (Allman braces, indented
# namespaces) and format-on-save rewrites whole files into a foreign style.
# clang-format, clangd and the VSCode extension all pick this up
# automatically once it is present.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
